## Best Practices

1. **Responsive feel**: Use velocity-based mode for natural dragging
2. **Value bounds**: Always clamp values to valid range
3. **Visual feedback**: Change appearance on hover/drag
4. **Accessibility**: Support keyboard navigation
5. **Automation**: Ensure slider updates from host automation

## Common Issues

### Slider jumps to click position
```cpp
setSliderStyle(Slider::LinearHorizontal);
setSliderSnapsToMousePosition(false);  // Fix: Snap to mouse
```

### Value text unreadable
```cpp
// Ensure proper contrast
g.setColour(findColour(Slider::textColourId));
```

### Automation not working
```cpp
// Use Attachment class for proper host integration
auto attachment = std::make_unique<AudioProcessorValueTreeState::SliderAttachment>(
    apvts, "paramID", slider);
```
